# Help: GFS2 filesystem
#
# GFS2_FS builds fs/gfs2/ with local locking and, for a cluster, the
# locking through the distributed lock manager (GFS2_FS_LOCKING_DLM).
#
# Prerequisites inlined per the self-containment rule:
# - DLM, on CONFIGFS_FS.
# See: fs/gfs2/Kconfig
# See: https://docs.kernel.org/filesystems/gfs2/index.html
CONFIG_CONFIGFS_FS=m
CONFIG_DLM=m
CONFIG_GFS2_FS=m
CONFIG_GFS2_FS_LOCKING_DLM=y
